# Story 96: Subscribing to a Remote Share (45s)
# Hook: Discover what your teammates are sharing, then subscribe to watch it live.
# Duration: 45s
# Source: story-096-subscribing-remote-share.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 7

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
Discover what your teammates are sharing, then subscribe to watch it live.

[00:03.0 --> 00:09.0]
Start rysh connected to your workspace and double-Escape into rysh mode.

[00:09.0 --> 00:18.0]
##upstream list-remote asks the server for every share in the workspace -- not just yours, but your teammates' too.

[00:18.0 --> 00:28.0]
Pick a share ID and ##upstream subscribe with view or control. A RemoteShareListenerActor pipes its output into your pane.

[00:28.0 --> 00:36.0]
##upstream my-shares now reflects what you're connected to, alongside anything you're publishing.

[00:36.0 --> 00:42.0]
Done watching? ##upstream unsubscribe stops the stream and tears down the listener.

[00:42.0 --> 00:45.0]
List, subscribe, unsubscribe -- the full remote-viewing loop.

